  {
   "id": "s1-ahmad",
   "section": "s1",
   "start": 24.875,
   "text": "I’m Ahmad. / I’m from Adirampattinam, a small town on the Tamil Nadu coast.",
   "words": 13,
   "hold_min": 5.1,
   "hold": 5.208,
   "ok": true,
   "lines": 2
  },
  {
   "id": "s1-family",
   "section": "s1",
   "start": 32.208,
   "text": "My family are scholars of Islam. / Most of us stop formal school around class ten or twelve.",
   "words": 17,
   "hold_min": 6.3,
   "hold": 6.417,
   "ok": true,
   "lines": 2
  },
  {
   "id": "s1-first",
   "section": "s1",
   "start": 40.958,
   "text": "I’m the first of us to go to college.",
   "words": 9,
   "hold_min": 3.9,
   "hold": 4.375,
   "ok": true,
   "lines": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "s1-father",
   "section": "s1",
   "start": 46.5,
   "text": "My father studied until the third grade. / He owned more than two thousand books.",
   "words": 14,
   "hold_min": 5.4,
   "hold": 5.5,
   "ok": true,
   "lines": 2
  },
  {
   "id": "s1-world",
   "section": "s1",
   "start": 54.292,
   "text": "Between nine and fifteen, before I had a phone, that library was how I left my world.",
   "words": 17,
   "hold_min": 6.3,
   "hold": 6.417,
   "ok": true,
   "lines": 2
  },
  {
   "id": "s1-dream",
   "section": "s1",
   "start": 62.333,
   "text": "It’s also where I got a dream far too big for the boy reading it.",
   "words": 15,
   "hold_min": 5.7,
   "hold": 5.833,
   "ok": true,
   "lines": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "s1-reason",
   "section": "s1",
   "start": 69.667,
   "text": "From seventh grade to tenth, I came first in all eighteen exams I wrote. / He was the reason.",
   "words": 18,
   "hold_min": 6.6,
   "hold": 7.208,
   "ok": true,
   "lines": 2
  },
  {
   "id": "s2-oct",
   "section": "s2",
   "start": 80.333,
   "text": "October 2018. / My maternal grandmother.",
